<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#999;padding:4px 14px 10px;font-style:italic;">Source: Trading Economics, FX Daily Report, Yahoo Finance. WTI daily close Feb 25 to Jun 8, 2026. &nbsp;|&nbsp; hdq.ca</div>
